Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Eighth Episode\NThe Bounty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the load on the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's me!\N- I'm opening right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to earn a million\Ndollars in one night, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A million?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- What? Dollars?! - Do you know\Nthe Princess of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- The one called Sapphire?\N- Yeah, exactly her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be kidnapped!\NI mean, bring her here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, friends, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For what purpose kidnap her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No questions, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A million dollars\Nto anyone who brings her here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, the back entrance\Nof the castle will not be guarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,nor locked!\NGood luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear how much he offered!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still more profitable\Nthan being a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so quiet..\NToo quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear this silence\Nis a prelude to something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Doctor Uranaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sleep,\Nit's too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was thinking the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s strange... While I was coming\Nhere, I didn't see in the corridors...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...any soldiers on guard.\NHow come?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No guards?! And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guards! Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- It should work.\N- Of course it will work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll see that everything will be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That bounty, we’re definitely\Nthe ones who are going to bag it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve got it all wrong,\Nbrothers! That loot will be ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve already got that money\Nin our pockets! Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For this job,\Nyou need professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s fast asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, she wasn't sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expecting some villains like you! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're awake, we'll have to resort to force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on!\N- Be a good girl, get in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Captain Blood! What a pleasure to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, old friend Blood! You want the bounty all for yourself, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The bounty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Blood! But what did those two want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you Princess Sapphire. Pay me the bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really her! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? What have you done, Captain Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? You know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hit me earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And who might this individual be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly and don't talk to me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- It bothers me!\N- Captain Blood is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You ask too many questions and you're too arrogant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But Captain Blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've collected the bounty that was on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you no longer interest me! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Captain!\NI'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- You aren't going anywhere!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?\NWhy can't I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You will stay with us for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's why!\N- Three days with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NWhat are these explosions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something on the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a workshop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me well! Did\Nyou hear the explosions?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the tests were successful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You will bring the gunpowder\Nto Silverland in several trips!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You must bring all the powder\Nto Silverland by tomorrow evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The day after tomorrow, or at noon\Non the third day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we will set off the powder\Nand blow up the entire city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured that we will destroy\Nthe entire kingdom of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Doesn't this\Nofficial notice seem like a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, not bad...\NIt will place upon Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...all the blame for the disasters\Nthat will occur!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, it will be a laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It says that they will build\Nan amusement park for children!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All the buildings located\Nin this area will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who does not obey the order\Nwill be sentenced to death on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The signature\Nis Princess Sapphire's!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Our houses! What cruelty!\NIt was she herself who ordered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's tearing down our houses just\Nto make an amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:10:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever has gotten into her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect this\Nfrom Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will we live, now that\Nour houses are destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Sapphire!\N- Who is calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard\NBlood's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's you!\NWhat have you come here to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise out there?\NI want to know what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I caught this man
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...who was walking\Nin front of Sapphire's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Captain Blood!\N- Yes, it's me:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Captain Blood, the pirate!\N- Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, wait a moment!\NI came here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...because I would like to change\Nmy line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't earn much\Nbeing a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you understand me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!\NThen have Sapphire come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,An "X"! You belong\Nto the X Union, as I suspected!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, tell me what\Nyour evil plan is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You amuse me! I was told\Nthat you are a spirited girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, though:\Ndo you know this man or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Blood! How did you\Nknow that they brought me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought\Nthat you had sold me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But who the hell are you?\NI’ve never seen you, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you realized\Nyet? I don’t know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re mistaking me\Nfor someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, I can’t believe\Nthat you’ve betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that something\Nterrible is about to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! Open up, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do with\Nthe Princess of Silverland...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...or whoever she is!\NI just want to stay with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and have the money!\N- I will satisfy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you can be useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, escort him\Nto the laboratory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned\Nnot to trust yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what nonsense is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X is not\Nas naive as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't trust you,\Nso you will stay there all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, you have exceeded\Nthe limits of our patience!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is too much now!\N- It's true, he's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you, people!\NYou're right to be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess must be crazy\Nfor having ordered...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...sweeping away the houses to make\Nroom for an amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She cannot treat\Nher subjects like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,who have always respected\Nand revered her on every occasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,However... you must respect\Nthis official ordinance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise you will be imprisoned\Nand your assets confiscated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, poor people of Silverland!\NHow you are being harassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon is a good actor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The gunpowder will arrive\Nin town this afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so they will blow up\Nwhat remains of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally,\Nit will be easy for Union X..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to conquer the kingdom of Silverland,\Nreduced to a pile of rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:14:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings to you,\Nmy most gracious Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that Sapphire has given orders\Nto tear down many houses in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,to make room\Nfor an amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly so, Your Majesty!\NNow the Princess, your daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...is inspecting the work and\Nsaid she would not return...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- until it is finished.\N- Oh, woe is us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe she\Nwould do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to ask her personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.18,0:15:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have happened\Nto her? Sapphire, come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out! Open up!\NWhat do you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not conquer Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Mother! Forgive\Nme! Forgive my helplessness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, open the\Nunderwater tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We must bring the gunpowder\Nto Silverland within an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoner is breaking free!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The man hasn't been born yet\Nwho can put Captain Blood in a cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that bastard throwing\Ndynamite into the fortress?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Quick!\NI've come to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you for coming.\N- Come on, we must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll free you from your chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to destroy what\Nremains of the city of Silverland...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...with gunpowder!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must escape\Nquickly from this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that bastard escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him and feed\Nhim to the sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand dollar reward\Nto whoever finds Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- There they are!\N- Let's get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Blood, you\Nwere putting on an act...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...to discover the true intentions\Nof Union X, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! I did all this for\Nyou and for your kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me, Sapphire:\Nget out of here and run...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...to Silverland, to prevent\Nthe city from being destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:18:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- And what will you do, Captain?\N- Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.14,0:18:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, you must save\Nyour country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Thank you, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Is it possible that you\Nstill haven't caught those two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm here!\N- What the hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take down all of you by\Nmyself, henchmen of Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You let Sapphire escape,\Nyou damned imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- I won't forgive you for this!\N- Come at me, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.58,0:18:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Come\Non, you have to take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Sapphire! I'll take\Ncare of stopping them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,\Nthat's gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to blow up the\Nhouses with that! We'll blow up too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have placed\Nall the powder, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! Soldier, now all\Nthat's left is to light the fuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Stop! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get her! It's the Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:19:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be a disaster\Nif I don't hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Princess Sapphire\Nis cutting the fuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But hadn't he ordered\Nto blow up the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's... That... it's Sapphire!\NIt really is Sapphire, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, who ordered the\Nblowing up of the houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But... But you signed the\Nofficial ordinance yourself, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- The official ordinance?!\N- Well done, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You arrived in time and\Nyou managed to prevent..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,. ...the destruction of Silverland!\N- You made it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:21:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I made it! I want to tell you\None thing, citizens of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It was those from Union X\Nwho planted the gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's move against them\Nand let's finish them all off together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Free me, Princess! What\Ndo you intend to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.82,0:21:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You will stay where you are until I\Nhave cleared up the doubts about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, they're attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,At them! At them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kill them all! At them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get them! At them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away! Come back!\NFight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NThey escaped on the carts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it! You bunch of cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at him! Too bad for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The cart is speeding away with him on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?\NWhy wasn't there an explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is this earthquake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.90,0:22:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The island! The island is sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what caused\Nall this upheaval!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it,\Nmy whole plan has failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.58,0:22:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.02,0:23:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire! We are\Nall extremely grateful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.06,0:23:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have saved our city\Nfrom destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.06,0:23:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot celebrate\Nvictory yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.18,0:23:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Union X army\Nis approaching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen:\Nonly if we work together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...all united for the protection\Nof our homeland,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,will we succeed in defeating\Nour enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our only chance of salvation.
